### AI Health Monitoring API (Phase 1) Test Collection
### Use with VS Code REST Client extension or convert to curl/Postman

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = YOUR_FIREBASE_ID_TOKEN_HERE

### ==========================================
### 1. HEALTH CHECK
### ==========================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/health


### ==========================================
### 2. PATIENTS MODULE
### ==========================================

### 2.1 Create Patient Profile (Post-Signup)
POST {{baseUrl}}/patients
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dob": "1998-05-15T00:00:00.000Z",
  "sex": "male",
  "heightCm": 178.5,
  "weightKg": 72.0,
  "conditions": ["Hypertension", "Diabetes Type 2"],
  "phone": "+919876543210"
}

### 2.2 Get Own Patient Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/patients/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2.3 Update Own Patient Profile
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/patients/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "weightKg": 71.2,
  "conditions": ["Hypertension"]
}

### 2.4 Add Emergency Contact
POST {{baseUrl}}/patients/me/emergency-contacts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mom",
  "phone": "+919876543210",
  "relation": "Mother"
}

### 2.5 Get Emergency Contacts
GET {{baseUrl}}/patients/me/emergency-contacts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ==========================================
### 3. DEVICES MODULE
### ==========================================

### 3.1 Connect Device
POST {{baseUrl}}/devices/connect
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "platform": "health_connect",
  "deviceName": "Samsung Galaxy Watch 6"
}

### 3.2 List Connected Devices
GET {{baseUrl}}/devices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3.3 Sync Device
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/devices/YOUR_DEVICE_ID_HERE/sync
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ==========================================
### 4. VITALS MODULE
### ==========================================

### 4.1 Ingest Vitals (Batch) — Normal Vitals
POST {{baseUrl}}/vitals/ingest
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceId": "YOUR_DEVICE_ID_HERE",
  "readings": [
    {
      "metric": "heart_rate",
      "value": 72.0,
      "unit": "bpm",
      "recordedAt": "2026-08-02T10:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "metric": "spo2",
      "value": 98.0,
      "unit": "%",
      "recordedAt": "2026-08-02T10:00:00.000Z"
    }
  ]
}

### 4.2 Ingest Vitals (Batch) — Threshold Breach (Triggers Alert)
POST {{baseUrl}}/vitals/ingest
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceId": "YOUR_DEVICE_ID_HERE",
  "readings": [
    {
      "metric": "heart_rate",
      "value": 142.0,
      "unit": "bpm",
      "recordedAt": "2026-08-02T10:05:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "metric": "spo2",
      "value": 91.0,
      "unit": "%",
      "recordedAt": "2026-08-02T10:05:00.000Z"
    }
  ]
}

### 4.3 Query Vitals Time-Range
GET {{baseUrl}}/vitals/YOUR_PATIENT_ID_HERE?metric=heart_rate&from=2026-08-01T00:00:00.000Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ==========================================
### 5. ALERTS MODULE
### ==========================================

### 5.1 List Alerts
GET {{baseUrl}}/alerts?status=open&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5.2 Acknowledge Alert
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/alerts/YOUR_ALERT_ID_HERE/acknowledge
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5.3 Submit Feedback on Alert
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/alerts/YOUR_ALERT_ID_HERE/feedback
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "label": "true_positive"
}

### 5.4 Trigger SOS Emergency Alert
POST {{baseUrl}}/alerts/sos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": 19.0760,
  "longitude": 72.8777
}


### ==========================================
### 6. AUTH FAILURE TESTS
### ==========================================

### 6.1 Missing Auth Header (Expect 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/patients/me

### 6.2 Invalid Token (Expect 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/patients/me
Authorization: Bearer invalid_token_xyz

### 6.3 Access Other Patient's Data (Expect 403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/vitals/other_patient_id_123
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
